  evidencePrefab: {fileID: 6586202626002414144, guid: b02f6cf486235c440987b4f4073b828e, type: 3}
  storyName: N/A
  storyDate: N/A
  storyDescription: "You know you have to tell me if you\u2019re a cop right it\u2019s
    against the law if you don\u2019t. Damn really you were related to him. I\u2019m
    sorry to hear that. I was hunting in the mountain range you see over there since
    it\u2019s deer season. Normally, you don\u2019t have to worry much about anything
    especially dangerous out here barring the occasional mountain lion. But as I
    was about to take a shot at a deer I had been hunting for a good 20 minutes I
    saw what I think is some sort of large animal or something just jump through
    and tackle the deer down. I try to shoot at it but it's like the sound of trigger
    pulling scares it off because it snapped its head towards me and then bolted
    in the other direction. Before I can get my bearings I get a call about the kid
    going missing in the woods an hour earlier and I let them know that there might
    be some weird animal in the woods and to be careful. If you want to keep looking
    for him just let me know and I\u2019ll go out searching with you."
  storyComments: "I went out looking for the kid. It sounded to me like he was just
    taken by a will formed construct but after investigation I\u2019m not too entirely
    sure. I will attempt to write more in the compendium."
